  "pillar_name": "Hybrid Athlete / Sport + Gym Balance",
  "subtopic": "Sport + Muscle Gain",
  "topic": "Building Muscle While Playing Sports",
  "scripts": [
    {
      "script_id": "SET-011-ORIGINAL",
      "script_version": "ORIGINAL",
      "status": "Ready",
      "hook_type": "ORIGINAL",
      "format": "Listicle",
      "original_slide_count": 11,
      "final_slide_count": 11,
      "slides": [
        {
          "slide_number": 1,
          "slide_label": "Slide 1",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "how I built muscle playing sports outside the gym"
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 2,
          "slide_label": "Slide 2",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "save this. you'll need it at the gym"
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 3,
          "slide_label": "Slide 3",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "I used to think running and padel were killing my gains, but it turned out to just be a scheduling problem."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 4,
          "slide_label": "Slide 4",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "I made lifting the foundation, and treated other sports as something that completes my week, not wrecks it."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 5,
          "slide_label": "Slide 5",
          "is_metafi_slide": true,
          "text": "also. get a lifting plan that adjusts around your sport\ntry the app"
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 6,
          "slide_label": "Slide 6",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "biggest mistake I made: training everything at max intensity like I never got tired."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 7,
          "slide_label": "Slide 7",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "learned to keep some days light so I could actually keep going without burning out."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 8,
          "slide_label": "Slide 8",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "food made a huge difference. more activity needs more food, not less."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 9,
          "slide_label": "Slide 9",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "don't play a sport and assume your body's building muscle while you're barely eating right all day."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 10,
          "slide_label": "Slide 10",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "sleep and rest aren't a luxury. they're what lets your body catch up to everything you're putting it through."
        },
        {
          "slide_number": 11,
          "slide_label": "Slide 11",
          "is_metafi_slide": false,
          "text": "bottom line: lifting, food, rest, and sports you actually enjoy. without turning your week into punishment."
        }
      ]
    },
